---
title: PROPOSED v2 - 3-month update and availability verification (planned next action, same as buyer)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Agent
    participant D as Action popup (same as buyer)
    participant U as Unit row
    participant A as Availability Verification action
    participant S as Daily scheduler
    participant M as Sales Manager

    G->>D: Price Decision accepted / owner sets price
    D->>U: listing_status = Listed, last_verified_on = today
    D->>A: Auto next action: Call - Availability Verification<br/>planned at today + 3 months (Event + ToDo)
    Note over U,A: One open verification per Unit (row lock) - never duplicated

    S->>A: Daily: planned date reached
    S->>U: listing_status = Verification Due (Unit still matchable)

    G->>D: Start the verification call, record result, final submit
    alt Available - same price or owner sets new price
        D->>U: Listed, last_verified_on = today
        D->>A: Next verification auto-planned at +3 months
    else Needs re-pricing
        D->>U: Pricing Requested, next action Agent Pricing required
    else Temporarily unavailable
        D->>U: Off Market (hidden from matching), follow-up call required
    else Sold elsewhere / withdrawn
        D->>U: Withdrawn (hidden), open buyer Interests flagged for their agents
    else No answer
        D->>A: No-answer counters updated, retry call required
    end

    S->>U: 7 days past due with no result: verification_overdue = 1
    S->>M: Overdue alert
    S->>U: 14 days past due: hidden from NEW Smart Match results
